ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitAtmos = atmos 硬式防護服頭盔 | atmos hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 一款專為在低壓、高溫環境中作業而設計的特殊重型防護服頭盔。 | A special hardsuit helmet designed for working in low-pressure, high thermal environments.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitEngineering = 工程用硬式機甲頭盔 | engineering hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 一款專為在低壓、高輻射環境中作業而設計的工程型重型防護服頭盔。 | An engineering hardsuit helmet designed for working in low-pressure, high radioactive environments.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitSpatio = 太空人硬式太空服頭盔 | spationaut hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 一款專為太空中的複雜工業作業所設計的堅固頭盔。 | A sturdy helmet designed for complex industrial operations in space.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitSalvage = 採礦硬式防護服頭盔 | mining hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 一款專為在危險的低壓環境中工作而設計的特殊頭盔。配備強化護甲，以應對與野生動物的遭遇，並配有雙氙氣投光燈。 | A special helmet designed for work in a hazardous, low pressure environment. Has reinforced plating for wildlife encounters and dual floodlights.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitGoliath = 歌利亞重型戰甲頭盔 | goliath hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 一頂堅固的機甲頭盔，融入了巨人皮革的元素，並從其上鑿出了一隻詭異、永不眨眼的眼睛。 | A sturdy hardsuit helmet, infused with a goliath's hide and an eerie, unblinking eye cut from its mass.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitMaxim = Salvager Maxim 頭盔 | salvager maxim helmet
    .desc = 一種衰敗的預感席捲了你的思緒。 | A predication of decay washes over your mind.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitSecurity = 安全重型裝甲頭盔 | security hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 用於安保需求的裝甲硬式防護服頭盔。 | Armored hardsuit helmet for security needs.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitBrigmedic = brigmedic 硬式防護服頭盔 | brigmedic hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 「布里格醫護」重型護甲的輕量級頭盔。可防禦病毒，以及小丑。 | The lightweight helmet of the brigmedic hardsuit. Protects against viruses, and clowns.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitWarden = 監獄長硬質裝甲頭盔 | warden's hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 一頂經過改裝的防暴頭盔。說來奇怪，戴起來還挺舒服的。 | A modified riot helmet. Oddly comfortable.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitCap = 船長的重型機甲頭盔 | captain's hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 專為太空站站長打造的特殊硬質頭盔。 | Special hardsuit helmet, made for the captain of the station.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitEngineeringWhite = 總工程師的硬質裝甲頭盔 | chief engineer's hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 專為該太空站首席工程師打造的特殊硬式太空服頭盔。 | Special hardsuit helmet, made for the chief engineer of the station.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitMedical = 醫務總管的硬質裝甲頭盔 | chief medical officer's hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 一款輕量級醫療用硬式頭盔，不會限制頭部活動。 | Lightweight medical hardsuit helmet that doesn't restrict your head movements.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitRd = 實驗性研究用動力裝甲頭盔 | experimental research hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 一款輕量級硬質頭盔，不會限制頭部活動。 | Lightweight hardsuit helmet that doesn't restrict your head movements.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitSecurityRed = 安全主管的硬質裝甲頭盔 | head of security's hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 配備最新絕密 NT-HUD 軟體的安全型重型戰甲頭盔。隸屬於 HoS。 | Security hardsuit helmet with the latest top secret NT-HUD software. Belongs to the HoS.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitLuxury = 豪華型採礦硬式防護服頭盔 | luxury mining hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 一頂翻新的採礦型重型護甲頭盔，內襯緞面軟墊，並加裝了一根額外的（無法運作的）天線——因為你就是那麼與眾不同。 | A refurbished mining hardsuit helmet, fitted with satin cushioning and an extra (non-functioning) antenna, because you're that extra.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitSyndie = 血紅色的硬質裝甲頭盔 | blood-red hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 一款專為特種作戰任務設計的重型防禦頭盔。屬戈爾萊克斯掠奪者所有。 | A heavily armored helmet designed for work in special operations. Property of Gorlex Marauders.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitSyndieMedic = 血紅色的醫療型強化裝甲頭盔 | blood-red medic hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 一款專為戰場醫護人員行動所設計的先進紅色硬質頭盔。 | An advanced red hardsuit helmet specifically designed for field medic operations.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitSyndieElite = 「辛迪加」精英頭盔 | syndicate elite helmet
    .desc = 這款血紅色硬質戰甲頭盔的精英版，具備更強的抗輻射與防火性能。為戈勒克斯掠奪者所有。 | An elite version of the blood-red hardsuit's helmet, with improved radiation resistance and fireproofing. Property of Gorlex Marauders.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitSyndieCommander = 辛迪加指揮官頭盔 | syndicate commander helmet
    .desc = 這款血紅色硬質戰甲頭盔的強化版，專為犯罪集團特遣隊指揮官量身打造。其裝甲性能大幅提升，足以應對前線那些致命的交火戰況。 | A bulked up version of the blood-red hardsuit's helmet, purpose-built for the commander of a syndicate operative squad. Has significantly improved armor for those deadly front-lines firefights.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitCybersun = cybersun 巨無霸頭盔 | cybersun juggernaut helmet
    .desc = 這頂頭盔由壓縮的紅色物質製成，是在陶族色球層設施中設計出來的。 | Made of compressed red matter, this helmet was designed in the Tau chromosphere facility.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitWizard = 巫師重型機甲頭盔 | wizard hardsuit helmet
    .desc = 一頂鑲滿寶石、散發魔法能量的奇特頭盔。 | A bizarre gem-encrusted helmet that radiates magical energies.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitLing = 有機太空頭盔 | organic space helmet
    .desc = 一種適用於太空環境、能耐受壓力與高溫的生物質組織。 | A spaceworthy biomass of pressure and temperature resistant tissue.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetHardsuitPirateEVA = 深空太空行走頭盔 | deep space EVA helmet
    .desc = 一款深空太空行走頭盔，雖然非常沉重，但防護效果極佳。 | A deep space EVA helmet, very heavy but provides good protection.
    .suffix = Pirate
